positions.description:
As a software engineer at MDLIVE, I’m a member of the Patient Portal team, which focuses on the web development of the platform for our patients. The main stack is SQL, Ruby on Rails in the backend, and JS + React in the frontend. The application related to MDLIVE main page also uses Typescript. The team follows agile methodology, in a 2-week sprint, and my experience working on this team includes: 
- Development of Product team projects  for the web patient portal;
- Development of improvements in backend, such as migration of existing features from legacy to new apps and improvements for better backend performance.
- API development for iOS and Android teams so both web app and mobile apps can be  aligned;
- Backend and frontend fixes for patient portal production issues;

